## SECTION P: PAYMENTS
- The UI shows only "Proceed to Secure Payment". Never display the gateway name or logo
  (Razorpay sits behind a provider-agnostic adapter; mock adapter in development).
- Flow: user picks plan → control plane computes price (Section O) and creates the order
  (plan = PENDING) → redirect to gateway → server-to-server webhook → verify signature → check
  idempotency, amount, currency, order and user match → ONLY THEN set plan = ACTIVE and
  allow entitlement tokens (Section E).
- The redirect/success page NEVER activates anything; it shows "Payment verification in
  progress" and polls the plan state until the webhook confirms.
- Handle failed, pending, duplicate, delayed, refunded and disputed events; automatic expiry,
  renewal and downgrade; invoices; everything audit-logged.

